	<TextRow
		Label="msg_n01r0401_boss_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あるひのこと　ボクの　まえに
おやと　なのる　おとこが　あらわれた
それが　ゲーチス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-03T08:33:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-03T08:33:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あるひのこと　ボクの　まえに
おやと　なのる　おとこが　あらわれた
それが　ゲーチス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-03T08:34:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-03T08:34:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
